msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ずっと続くと思っていたんだ。"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ずっと続くと思っていたんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4b28d3ba09fc7075113caacbfcc2a8e1858a26d185747f835c272eef5907a643
#. default-sha256: 9b5034bcb776b77132414b10833832269925fccc881b6f6a2bc40128cdf14e1f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6D4A6043_416B_46F2_A818_09047036F42A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Following my seventeenth birthday, though, I was met with a deluge of changes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫十七の誕生日が過ぎて、⟪k:2⟫僕の身の回りは急変した。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bac75754eaedf13b372afa2aa07a49e252c5a250384d3cb7533ca912d5bf27d1
#. default-sha256: 41e0c93e103883e76fd5689383315474639520dafde24edbcdee8791f38a3070
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_883F4211_6033_496C_BE63_ED1944B379B3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫First, Father fell ill... ⟪k:1⟫and passed away shortly thereafter...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫With his death "
"came the question of who would be the next head."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫まず父が倒れて……、⟪k:1⟫そのまま帰らぬ人となって……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫親族たちは後継者について話し合うよ"
"うになったんだ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d319170332d7fb9e40093fb19481fd525d5f0f4dfe85c9de7bb92befc339829
#. default-sha256: df349a2adab81216a3170916cff02acfdb5b55afc05879a0c73a3635f1f61606
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E8664530_9C0B_4427_A024_B001D2D828C6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was seventeen, by all means enough of an adult to handle things myself. ⟪k:1⟫Or, well, "
"that’s what I thought, anyway."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫僕はもう十七だし、⟪k:1⟫十分大人としてやっていける年だった。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫少なくとも僕はそう思って"
"いたけれど――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b7c87f9b8e06b9a0b7606f9702500ba3cccb26651dfaf6c00c22e4bb0586f961
#. default-sha256: 5ce521f3205980f1139c0135a7c7901924b0a937bd7791bbd662de8f82d754cf
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D6EA55_93D4_4349_B408_461C0E607BBD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a small house, far from home—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫his way of making it hard for me to come back. "
"⟪k:3⟫Not that I had any intention of returning."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫僕が簡単に戻ってこれないようにしたかったんだろうな。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫まあ、⟪k:3⟫僕だって戻るつもりは"
"なかったけどさ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 77b57e213bd330eddb042fe75a3bc72ef232c26dee255484c0c6611fc73d714f
#. default-sha256: 0f40a00827029abcf373f79f17a6e2953d0d12293574dfaa0f8c8f9692bdd0df
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9ED9BC65_C2CF_4A8C_B5AD_A023DD82E8A8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫was you coming with me, Nellie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ネリー、⟪k:1⟫君が、⟪k:2⟫僕についてきてくれたことだった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 638d08d785944f6dee33b0231a288a1f21d7efb57c999327e868529747d24a3f
#. default-sha256: bf1549bb111800543ced9d42b4b867953ae02438fb04367da525cdaf998a2d34
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A707CFE_FA03_44E0_A1D5_9FF34BAF6EC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Yep, so it is..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫……まあ、⟪k:4⟫そうだね……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 530db80e68ee2ae58b6df8db24d3a6a3ead5a6ad0119e752cff05e805d493d12
#. default-sha256: e1b79c40d3836588499b84fa821ee721a91a2142ae513d17e48010b918f4bbde
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3B09AAB0_11F7_4DC2_8A1E_301630E77B6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It’s amazing how... ⟪k:1⟫little there is.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫No big yard, no paintings, no vases "
"filled with colorful flowers,⟪k:4⟫no silver bowls full of fresh-picked fruit..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫本当に……、⟪k:1⟫何もないね。⟪k:2⟫大きな庭も、⟪k:3⟫絵画の一枚も、⟪k:4⟫花をいける花瓶もなけれ"
"ば、⟪k:5⟫銀皿に詰まった果物も――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1f12b362fd8da0b9d3d04fef6b6a8cbd24fead20f11a70609f4b54647ddfd38
#. default-sha256: 1ba742573fd9f671d9771450136dd4b7cd844da1a1b11dd17d04362a8be409ac
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_56069B73_DD4D_4AD7_946C_E8F53FDA49CA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I’ll do whatever I can for you, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Are you hungry? I’m hungry."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ネリーもお兄さまのためにがんばるわ。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ねえねえお兄さま、⟪k:4⟫おなかすいてない？"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f9be085f5faefaef51b7466b6e4537aa4b6dbb20139a1876a6c31e3cded5f98e
#. default-sha256: c80aff93c71d3ee6e1573af8850bc1ac6ccddc200bbda49acc4508d341c9c439
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D2D83A47_3DEB_471B_8B8A_BEC74F5135A1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Oh, ⟪k:3⟫uh, ⟪k:4⟫yeah... ⟪k:5⟫a bit..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あ、⟪k:3⟫うん……、⟪k:4⟫ちょっと……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_456D81FB_F82E_47BD_97A1_82A739013DE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6679dfb9e010bd8a7367b1ce459c6f8278dda0bbd603a55b8f99c92c8b347695
#. default-sha256: 1ede36d8502b64de97fc6d6d99aef038ba1159922de4723d6a0a610e05755c47
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_456D81FB_F82E_47BD_97A1_82A739013DE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:3⟫You’ve got quite the sweet tooth.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫You’re going to make "
"yourself sick like that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あはは……、⟪k:3⟫お菓子だらけじゃないか。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫それだと、⟪k:6⟫そのうち身体を壊し"
"てしまうよ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E889B4A3_99B7_4667_B645_7DCF4851A94B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d77238afeedd6df3158abc9407b0e4b65dd481264b40504c2877287604604f29
#. default-sha256: 5165e918e61b81b6eece9de0da0c60e7c0f0d0c57999fffe8bab54a8d96b60d0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E889B4A3_99B7_4667_B645_7DCF4851A94B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nope. You’ve been frowny all day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫ううん、⟪k:2⟫さっきまで、⟪k:3⟫とっても辛そうな顔をしていたわ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_767724A6_D98E_4BD5_AFF8_BA858482FB90
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61e215393c7248ee3290116bb0f96f651b4eb0c27d4dcd325e0a79e27f5f80d9
#. default-sha256: a7351aa4a46cbae673aa91fcc420d383896c6642db75ecb404625819a0793297
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_767724A6_D98E_4BD5_AFF8_BA858482FB90"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Whatever you say..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫……そうかな……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9595E7DE_C5BA_4AE0_81B9_A11C331F0E2D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ccebe522b25710f320e490011a15f6c813eb79c83f24eef9b90e6fcc459bef8e
#. default-sha256: 1ad90825735db993fc35e8f1eac09a42cc02c11179da4242bd603d60c4c2d458
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9595E7DE_C5BA_4AE0_81B9_A11C331F0E2D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Forget about all that stuff at home.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫We’ve got each other! We can do this!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫おうちのことなんて、⟪k:2⟫どうだっていいじゃない。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫一緒にいたら何だってがんばっ"
"ていけるわ！"

#: scenario8:scenario8_85C710CC_5FC8_4871_A087_9B1BF1901128
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 920b780def744530012bc2fd6b18303f4c26ad8726602edd9738e3364eabff11
#. default-sha256: ae105b2bc3d1d36abccf6e3ba05fe42e96bbf932d2f32ac7423e0380e422798a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85C710CC_5FC8_4871_A087_9B1BF1901128"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’ll all work out, dearest Mell.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll always be here for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫大丈夫よ、⟪k:2⟫お兄さま。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ネリーはずっと、⟪k:5⟫お兄さまの傍にいるわ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0D01B5C2_D45E_475E_B13F_467EE109DEE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b966ea81c701e2bf402491b895beb575923de2afefbd36ef75be35e186bcc74
#. default-sha256: 466e9744102da157da62a40a4ddee363abcaf75c605209108402add784573ef6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0D01B5C2_D45E_475E_B13F_467EE109DEE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I suppose so..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……そうだね……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_276FC91D_6FDC_4871_B020_4A14D8E5C672
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 32c3c9cbebbe698dbf9bc4630fabea396b3a3e10ac457f100f9c1c15bac51f57
#. default-sha256: 641c2007f9ccb8fcfae8487b2405b05c3335847846245fcbcb26557f7092dbd8
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_276FC91D_6FDC_4871_B020_4A14D8E5C672"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My whole life had changed so abruptly, so dramatically,⟪k:1⟫that my mind just wasn’t able to "
"keep up."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫動かなければいけないのは分かっていたけれど、⟪k:1⟫突然一変してしまった生活に、⟪k:2⟫僕の心はつ"
"いていけてなかった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_C48E29E4_2F8A_4181_BFEC_D4F2E839E1CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c551f34c7d970b4dae25187bb831ec40d0c33b6ace5b506a2be3459c27b4eb9a
#. default-sha256: 83ad3d6850ed7e8d651047bc5f900c8e18db611898bad797f984f7962fcda037
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_C48E29E4_2F8A_4181_BFEC_D4F2E839E1CF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Our new life together was quiet and unremarkable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫二人で暮らす生活は、⟪k:1⟫何事もない平和な毎日だった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CD5F140F_2A30_4E96_B8D2_45E6694D1B3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3d0ff1f9898e20a8cbac2952c81c6ae1c294008301b90fb147eacace014c64c
#. default-sha256: 08a3e71fc38291ff16817a3cb5077e77ce716954710efa7f9fcbae5b0d71a659
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CD5F140F_2A30_4E96_B8D2_45E6694D1B3E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I was... ⟪k:3⟫planning on using it for supper."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫いや、⟪k:3⟫鳥料理にどうかと思って。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_DDE67F71_752F_46B9_B0BF_974E59FB2505
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c8dcb641207cedf15e6a0b21c2562d5ca34d3489d9d4cb0c6930b9a4bd40a7b
