#. native-sha256: e5f69009923bd3f490b1e6351e5c3c8ec6c807373288f3d7884c0732d31cce47
#. default-sha256: 1ad6e2b6733619b5fbbaca4a6828358bf3a0a6c0fa95e27e23cf9dcff74bf532
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_97CE0C15_BBB1_48F1_966B_F633997388E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but as much as I tried to convince myself, “Oh, she’ll be better tomorrow,” she just kept "
"getting worse, until eventually, she couldn’t even get out of bed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫明日には良くなる、⟪k:1⟫明日には大丈夫って思い続けながら、⟪k:2⟫結局、⟪k:3⟫彼女はベッドから起き"
"られない状態になってしまった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_293DB283_1A79_43BB_940D_3FC08217DF56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6298c030d5518d08a0b25f909eea06b898ecd1ed14a051b55c393802760467e
#. default-sha256: 5967b2bc1f6a2888689896c2bed5ff903f50c6a2552a137d63cbb73f6d1a6d4e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_293DB283_1A79_43BB_940D_3FC08217DF56"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’ll make something you like. How about a nice, expensive chicken? ⟪k:1⟫The last one got "
"away, but I won’t let that happen this time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ネリーの好きな鳥料理、⟪k:1⟫僕が作ってみようか？　⟪k:2⟫豪勢なやつをさ。⟪k:3⟫この前は逃げられ"
"ちゃったけど、⟪k:4⟫今度はきっと大丈夫だから。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7247EBBD_ACBB_4896_8C08_F41DDC4CD030
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eaf8798d886d7ed8a6c51b8db65801ac855b770188b9e02cfe2e859f571288bf
#. default-sha256: b57d7064ee58a0f84a074b91970e2662078ac7db6fa9951ddcf9bdfc3cf536ee
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7247EBBD_ACBB_4896_8C08_F41DDC4CD030"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Don’t you worry, Mell...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I’ll be better before you know it..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫大丈夫よ、⟪k:1⟫お兄さま……。⟪k:2⟫心配しないでも、⟪k:3⟫すぐによくなるわ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_B7FD887E_6647_4B33_8C5A_73F39F68D475
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 78fb3eef9cf109c61125a85cf65508236cd210df4beb5ff02fa71711e3a74abe
