msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B7FD887E_6647_4B33_8C5A_73F39F68D475"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Yeah. Yeah, you will...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You’ll be just fine."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……うん、⟪k:1⟫そうだよね……。⟪k:2⟫大丈夫……、⟪k:3⟫だよね。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7656D0B4_D829_4428_A94D_D0D75FFC0FC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e683e65de1159f1c90c2ff01cceadbbf91b7f66842e114994297fa9c9f751ed5
#. default-sha256: 51f099315626c70a55bb1f7bf8da773e3749c5f4f32734fd28441f9041c014db
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7656D0B4_D829_4428_A94D_D0D75FFC0FC6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everything’s going to be back to normal soon..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫僕たちの生活は……、⟪k:1⟫もう、⟪k:2⟫何も変わらないよね……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5c442834d217b7618fbc725d67610cf0855fc1a306e11277ba94cd670181401a
#. default-sha256: 52aef96d647983fe8f1024378a962b74226256c9563e598ada3295e490568485
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0423FDF5_FF77_4665_8471_0BFCAFBE6DA1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I searched everywhere for some medicine that could cure her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Healthy foods, fruits "
"and vegetables with supposed medicinal properties—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫anything I could get my hands on."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫だから僕は、⟪k:1⟫必死に薬を探し回った。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫身体に良いと言われる食べ物も、⟪k:4⟫果物も、"
"⟪k:5⟫片っ端から集めてさ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_6956578F_0EA8_47FA_BEAD_3D9CE72F54C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: feeb32a9db1a966bb84da441dc40744cfc334a0f59578ee3f33a142d8d9a4b92
#. default-sha256: cb0edd3f94dd6688d81e22e0660539a80a8ffc1e23b30ca59d6c8fb575d149b1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6956578F_0EA8_47FA_BEAD_3D9CE72F54C6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was really doing it for myself..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫本当は……、⟪k:1⟫僕のためだったんだよ……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2BF65C28_D0EF_4D1A_8512_2F5231A14D79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 98973526fba19ab3d9507202a4350b51172ddd61a1c07a80ae16f39bf2f4e97e
#. default-sha256: 4c8655a88eda49132d5a39d77d3206071aa10df45495d01a43df227fa0fbaf1d
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2BF65C28_D0EF_4D1A_8512_2F5231A14D79"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would go to bed at night afraid I’d wake up the next morning...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and Nellie "
"wouldn’t."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫朝になって、⟪k:1⟫ネリーがもし目を覚まさなかったらどうしようと……その瞬間が恐ろしくてならなかっ"
"た。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80b279f50684ecd5877acadce4ec132fcf0e5f5b57551af43e41b2e5ed9923a0
#. default-sha256: cc6a0d0217aa0366343f15eb372eb960801432f4fb44a570b15b86a8c516579e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_758D1741_451D_42C8_8E0D_94FF9BF61F48"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then one day, I heard whispers—⟪k:1⟫whispers of a witch who lived by the lake."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そんな時にね、⟪k:1⟫噂を聞いたんだ。⟪k:2⟫湖畔に住む魔女の噂を……ね。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc9f2cc6ebb88c2d4f25d282ac2ae07b1556aea9bf988d8c0d337d488509db1d
#. default-sha256: 3b154bab50162816f4118944f2c0b5adafece76e4def0da52e63a7ff19e3347b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_028B8958_691D_4F59_8716_03D9CB1616A1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Seeing the thin trails of smoke rising from the chimney, I was convinced the rumors were "
"true. A witch lived in that house."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫煙突からはゆっくりと湯気が立ち上っていて――、⟪k:1⟫噂通り、⟪k:2⟫魔女が住んでいるんだって僕は"
"思ったよ。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90cf4e1461eedffb4dd1e5c28d7d0e406dd96213d20173d0a9977b884d635476
#. default-sha256: 7dab12ce5335615dd2a4ccc0b3265fe0231a44dfa977821b66a5f5a5103ec7c1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A3DB912_0F1D_4E9B_BA67_426404BF8468"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wasn’t sure what to expect. Being a recluse, I figured she wasn’t going to be very "
"sociable, at least. ⟪k:1⟫To tell you the truth, I was kind of scared to knock on her door."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫どんな人がいるのか分からなかったし、⟪k:1⟫世捨て人なら気難しいのかもしれない。⟪k:2⟫正直、⟪k:3⟫"
"おっかなびっくりだったけど……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7b19446ab564e4c8ebe898771e0632edbfdf7e147fb1c8ca2a3d1f963de65406
#. default-sha256: 57f300c2f9d5efc19fa002ffae818a896d7166a9b1785ac80ea6228509d5c970
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9873A66F_9A39_4DE5_B2CA_8367360A0FCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And even though she’d only said two words, there was something... ⟪k:1⟫indescribably "
"enchanting about that voice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それだけじゃなくて――、⟪k:1⟫たった一言しか発していないのに、⟪k:2⟫彼女の声には吸い寄せるような"
"何かがあった。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_CCBC4967_FFFA_4687_85F8_B4D94E23F6B3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b133e3478f279a7621c28f66f245a6e37bc713fa1c2275068a65da17dcfd1dad
