msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_CCBC4967_FFFA_4687_85F8_B4D94E23F6B3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Who’s there?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……誰……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47b290f768c79abf7b4f6dd0d30114d49a13bb8115f230ca3b313553dd6393e2
#. default-sha256: fb22d623f91a947babf865c2a91e9e9c39eef47572625cb427da12115cb3ccda
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0408CBB2_F9C7_4690_B5DD_06FB542FBEF8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She repeated her question, which brought me back to reality, ⟪k:1⟫though I still had to "
"fight to maintain my wits enough to respond coherently."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫もう一度そう問われて、⟪k:1⟫はっとして、⟪k:2⟫ようやく僕は返事をした。⟪k:3⟫なんとか、⟪k:4⟫しっ"
"かりと話せるように、⟪k:5⟫意識して……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 41ddea01683ce5665975df61bd664ccc184e2133f941fac1458c44dff5495f0c
#. default-sha256: 8863da4ac1a55a5c1c2dc5214a035f526da5199787c25d6e2800e52a1b81ef51
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_2FB7C6B2_E1E4_40FD_9D03_BCD0FDDC7FD2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, ⟪k:1⟫uh, ⟪k:2⟫she’s got an extremely high fever that won’t come down...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫She has "
"no appetite—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫she’s only drinking water—⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫and she can’t get out of bed..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫あ、⟪k:1⟫えっと、⟪k:2⟫とにかくすごい熱で……。⟪k:3⟫食欲もなくて、⟪k:4⟫飲み物くらいしか口にしな"
"いんです。⟪k:5⟫ずっと起き上がれなくて……。"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D1E81EE0_61A3_402A_BBA0_6E92397B5916
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fffe63700d7f06fddf0c579484f7b44ed62796eb20b95b58a9bd5a6299efc57a
