#: scenario8:scenario8_C9F0D52C_DB44_4957_A2F9_A16B21400440
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eb821ba17e68d9c8db19cb791fbbf5587ef79de020e6934e21610477fa276fcb
