msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Yeah. We’re both young, but we’ve been through some rough times..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫うん、⟪k:3⟫だって、⟪k:4⟫まだ若いのに苦労してて……。"

